+## Deploy on Wasmer
+
+[![Deploy to Wasmer](https://img.shields.io/badge/Deploy%20to-Wasmer-6B4EFF)](https://wasmer.io/apps/create?github=Nutlope%2Fllamatutor)
+
+Wasmer detects Next.js, installs dependencies with pnpm (from `pnpm-lock.yaml`), runs `pnpm run build` (`next build`) and serves the production build with Node. The button builds this public repo as-is and does not fork or copy it; to customize the app (start with `app/page.tsx`) and redeploy on every push, fork it and connect your fork from the Wasmer dashboard. Set these in the app's Settings → Environment Vars:
+
+| Variable | Required | Purpose |
+| --- | --- | --- |
+| `TOGETHER_API_KEY` | Yes | Chat answers |
+| `EXA_API_KEY` | Yes | Source search (`/api/getSources` fails without it) |
+| `HELICONE_API_KEY` | Recommended | Chat requests are sent through Helicone's Together gateway |
+| `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL`, `UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN` | No | Rate limiting (10 chats per IP per day); skipped when unset |
+
